  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A spaceship is orbiting moon A with speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{A}\"></span> at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> from the centre of the moon. A different spaceship is orbiting moon B with speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{B}\"></span> also at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> from the centre of the moon. The mass of moon A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4m\"></span> and the mass of moon B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9m\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{A}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v_{B}}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3v_{B}}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4v_{B}}{9}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9v_{B}}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
